			"date": "2026-01-30T18:03:02.167Z",
			"content": "<p>When I think of developer tools, I think of things that attempt to eat the world via abstraction: Tailwind was one of those vs CSS. JSX was another vs JS. Not a complementary tool to existing workflows, you have to buy-in wholesale. I wouldn’t judge Polypane in the same light, fwiw!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:z6uec3g7xgkvxpy442663waq/app.bsky.feed.post/3mdnvrqonrk2f",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mdnv6ganis2d",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/kilianvalkhof.com/post/3mdnvrqonrk2f",
