				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z6uec3g7xgkvxpy442663waq/bafkreierzj24duh6a4bulcv46iest4pl5zzvbmgrnetuzkd2ff66spv2lq"
			},
			"date": "2026-01-30T18:13:50.646Z",
			"content": "<p>Right! I usually think of developer tools as anything external that you use to develop: the hammer rather than the nails and timber.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
