			"date": "2026-01-30T18:30:42.307Z",
			"content": "<p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:z6uec3g7xgkvxpy442663waq\">@kilianvalkhof.com</a> makes not a hammer but a whole workshop and lab that helps us make and test the best things we can with our own hands.</p>\n<p>Frameworks tell us we don't need the workshop and lab, just use their building blocks. Just a shame the blocks never *quite* fit together like we want them to...</p>",
